      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nThis game practices the multiplication tables of 0, 1, 2 and 3. Before you play, we suggest reviewing:\n\n- **Multiplying with the body (Level 1)**: a game to practice multiplication with the times tables you already know (<htcite0>)\n- **Understanding the Multiplication Table (2 and 3)**: how multiplication relates to triangles and to the multiplication table (<htcite1>)",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "59648475-3d23-45fe-8d6e-f3def1a2729b",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Multiplying with the body (Level 1)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "-1",
                        "day": "-1"
                     }
                  },
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "f7f4988d-1427-4e26-a6a8-c375c57924c7",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Understanding the Multiplication Table (2 and 3)",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2026",
                        "month": "-1",
